  "releaseNotes": "- **Improved:** Updated `DotMake.CommandLine` to `v3.7.0`.\n          Note that option short aliases for `svg-sprite build` and `svg-sprite extract` commands are changed:\n          All are now single character e.g. `-O` and not `-oe` for `--overwrite-existing`.\n\n        - **Improved:** Updated target framework for the tool to `net8.0`\n          and also added `net8.0` as additional target framework to the library.\n\n        - **Improved:** Strong name sign the DLLs for NuGet package. Signing will be done only when `DotMake.snk` exists,\n          it's not committed to this repository.",
